 프로토콜이다. 랜덤 접속 프로토콜에","words":[{"text":"다중","x":544,"y":710,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"접속","x":625,"y":711,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"프로토콜의","x":702,"y":711,"width":163,"height":37},{"text":"두","x":881,"y":713,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"번째","x":930,"y":711,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"종류는","x":1007,"y":713,"width":102,"height":36},{"text":"랜덤","x":1124,"y":711,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"접속","x":1205,"y":711,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"프로토콜이다.","x":1284,"y":712,"width":221,"height":38},{"text":"랜덤","x":1525,"y":712,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"접속","x":1611,"y":712,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜에","x":1695,"y":714,"width":156,"height":38}]},{"text":"서 전송 노드는 항상 채널의 최대 전송률인 R bps로 전송한다. 충돌이 생기면 충돌과","words":[{"text":"서","x":544,"y":770,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"전송","x":592,"y":770,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"노드는","x":670,"y":772,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"항상","x":785,"y":770,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"채널의","x":866,"y":770,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"최대","x":980,"y":770,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"전송률인","x":1062,"y":770,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"R","x":1209,"y":776,"width":23,"height":27},{"text":"bps로","x":1245,"y":775,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"전송한다.","x":1352,"y":772,"width":149,"height":37},{"text":"충돌이","x":1519,"y":773,"width":104,"height":36},{"text":"생기면","x":1644,"y":772,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"충돌과","x":1762,"y":772,"width":91,"height":40}]},{"text":"관련된 각 노드는 프레임(패킷)이 충돌 없이 전송될 때까지 자신의 프레임을 계속해서","words":[{"text":"관련된","x":542,"y":830,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"각","x":655,"y":829,"width":32,"height":37},{"text":"노드는","x":699,"y":832,"width":101,"height":34},{"text":"프레임(패킷)이","x":812,"y":829,"width":222,"height":39},{"text":"충돌","x":1050,"y":830,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"없이","x":1133,"y":830,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"전송될","x":1213,"y":830,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"때까지","x":1331,"y":831,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"자신의","x":1449,"y":832,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"프레임을","x":1572,"y":832,"width":143,"height":37},{"text":"계속해서","x":1730,"y":832,"width":119,"height":39}]},{"text":"재전송한다. 그러나 충돌했을 때 노드는 해당 프레임을 즉시 재전송할 필요가 없다. 대","words":[{"text":"재전송한다.","x":542,"y":890,"width":172,"height":38},{"text":"그러나","x":729,"y":890,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"충돌했을","x":840,"y":889,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"때","x":988,"y":890,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"노드는","x":1032,"y":892,"width":102,"height":34},{"text":"해당","x":1148,"y":890,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"프레임을","x":1227,"y":891,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"즉시","x":1379,"y":892,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"재전송할","x":1465,"y":892,"width":145,"height":37},{"text":"필요가","x":1624,"y":892,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"없다.","x":1744,"y":891,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"대","x":1827,"y":897,"width":23,"height":34}]},{"text":"신 그 프레임을 재전송하기 전에 랜덤 지연 시간 동안 기다린다. 퓨과 관련된 각 노드는","words":[{"text":"신","x":540,"y":953,"width":29,"height":33},{"text":"그","x":582,"y":956,"width":32,"height":26},{"text":"프레임을","x":626,"y":952,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"재전송하기","x":764,"y":952,"width":152,"height":35},{"text":"전에","x":932,"y":952,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"랜덤","x":1008,"y":952,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"지연","x":1082,"y":952,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"시간","x":1157,"y":952,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"동안","x":1233,"y":953,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"기다린다.","x":1313,"y":954,"width":137,"height":34},{"text":"퓨과","x":1468,"y":952,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"관련된","x":1591,"y":952,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"각","x":1714,"y":952,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"노드는","x":1760,"y":956,"width":91,"height":35}]},{"text":"자신만의 랜덤 지연 시간을 선택한다. 충돌이 생긴 후 각 노드는 지연 시간을 스스로","words":[{"text":"자신만의","x":541,"y":1011,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"랜덤","x":689,"y":1011,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"지연","x":771,"y":1011,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"시간을","x":852,"y":1011,"width":98,"height":38